Changes made in this version (September 2026):
  - Added a mobile app shell (live_demo/mobile/) that starts the claim from inside an insurer app.
  - Added signed-in account context so the agent greets by name and skips identity questions.
  - Added a spoken greeting, echo cancellation, a client-side barge-in gate, and tuned voice detection.
  - Added scope guardrails: auto claims only and claim topics only, with a deterministic routing gate.
  - Turned the incident sketch tool off by default and made it configurable.
  - Added same-Wi-Fi HTTPS access for phones, restricted to private network addresses.
  - Added erase-on-exit for claims, and removed third-party font requests from the mobile page.
  - Added setup and run scripts and a scope-gate test suite.

"Wrenfield Insurance" is a made-up name and the screens are illustrative. This is a demo with mock policy data. It is not an
insurance product and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any insurer.
